Keep a shared rods as an empty list of whole numbers.
Keep a shared current as an empty list of whole numbers.
Keep a shared following as an empty list of whole numbers.
Keep a shared total as 0.
Keep a shared size as 0.
Keep a shared center as 0.
Place 1 into rods.
Place 2 into rods.
Place 3 into rods.
Place 6 into rods.

For each rod in rods.
Set total to total plus rod.

Set size to total times 2 plus 1.
Set center to total.
For every slot from 0 to size minus 1.
Place -1 into current.

For every slot from 0 to size minus 1.
Place -1 into following.

Set item center of current to 0.

To extend with rod (a whole number).
For every slot from 0 to size minus 1.
If item slot of current is at least 0.
The height is item slot of current.
If height is more than item slot of following, set item slot of following to height.
The upper is slot plus rod.
If upper is less than size.
The raised is height plus rod.
If raised is more than item upper of following, set item upper of following to raised.
The diff is slot minus center.
The raw is diff minus rod.
The gap is the absolute value of raw.
The lower is gap plus center.
The shifted is height.
If rod is more than diff, set shifted to height plus rod minus diff.
If shifted is more than item lower of following, set item lower of following to shifted.

For each rod in rods.
Extend with rod.
For every slot from 0 to size minus 1.
Set item slot of current to item slot of following.
Set item slot of following to -1.

The middle is center.
Show item middle of current.
